      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would prefer that we still read the encryption key size even if we support `set_min_encryption_key_size`.\n\n`read_encryption_key_size` contains a security mitigation that check that the controller indeed negotiated a key that is inside the ranges of the Bluetooth specification (\u003e\u003d 7). Even if a new controller that supports `set_min_encryption_key_size` should not have this bug (As I think it\u0027s tested by the qual program). As a host, I would prefer to not trust the controller here and check twice 😊",
      "revId": "80a338f3b20eb4abe80ee8854fbcc1f4860c5078",
